{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Ultimate Warrior Mage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield mighty weapons and unleash devastating magic as you grapple, glide, fight, and explore across a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Legendary Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Master Sword. The Lich Hammer. There are whispers of many more. Find them and their powers are yours: each with unique traits suiting a variety of different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Ancient Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Crests are ancient magic items that hold the essence of long-forgotten warriors. Collect them to learn their power: and live your wildest battlemage fantasies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Lovingly Crafted Metroidvania World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grapple, Glide, Summon Platforms and more! Find Artifices to unlock the world and discover its deepest secrets. Experience the thrill of exploration with the challenge of platforming. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully-voiced story. Every line of dialogue is performed by a talented cast of voice actors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living world, where each biome has its own theme, lore, dangers, and challenges.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected map. Explore as you wish. Gain abilities to unlock areas. Find shortcuts, hidden passages, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, quests everywhere! Find characters to help and mysteries to solve throughout the world. But beware: your choices have consequences.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable boss fights. Bosses will test you to your limits. Beating them will require skill, tactical-thinking, and unlocking the full potential of your weapons and powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your build. Mix and match various weapons and different powers to create a build that reflects your playstyle. Each unique weapon has stats that can be unlocked by defeating enemies and upgrading at the vendor.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2201910?t=1758199859","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758199859","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/d66388f3a06f961e9bde3041e8a9d3147c65620a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758199859","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/d66388f3a06f961e9bde3041e8a9d3147c65620a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758199859","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2321390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Join Our Community on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/5f5d2af0b29b9172b209d5828bc6834d.avif?t=1758199859\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become the Ultimate Warrior Mage.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wield mighty weapons and unleash devastating magic as you grapple, glide, fight, and explore across a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/c197c52ddec8ae514ad0a21a7bbc514f.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Legendary Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The Master Sword. The Lich Hammer. There are whispers of many more. Find them and their powers are yours: each with unique traits suiting a variety of different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/906aa584e41661eb04dd56625fe76c55.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock Ancient Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Crests are ancient magic items that hold the essence of long-forgotten warriors. Collect them to learn their power: and live your wildest battlemage fantasies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/7d5a7aca8592fefe401cf972e6e6c9d8.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Lovingly Crafted Metroidvania World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Grapple, Glide, Summon Platforms and more! Find Artifices to unlock the world and discover its deepest secrets. Experience the thrill of exploration with the challenge of platforming. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.poster.avif?t=1758199859\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.webm?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/extras/1842db7e7a8ec9aff54242134e25820e.mp4?t=1758199859\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MORE FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully-voiced story. Every line of dialogue is performed by a talented cast of voice actors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living world, where each biome has its own theme, lore, dangers, and challenges.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected map. Explore as you wish. Gain abilities to unlock areas. Find shortcuts, hidden passages, and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests, quests everywhere! Find characters to help and mysteries to solve throughout the world. But beware: your choices have consequences.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memorable boss fights. Bosses will test you to your limits. Beating them will require skill, tactical-thinking, and unlocking the full potential of your weapons and powers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your build. Mix and match various weapons and different powers to create a build that reflects your playstyle. Each unique weapon has stats that can be unlocked by defeating enemies and upgrading at the vendor.</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Brewed Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2201910/a40729b91b88b49e76983a06767723b83b545b2a/header.jpg?t=1758199859","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.13.6+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 5000 (must support Metal API)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> MacBook Air, MacBook Pro, iMac, Mac Mini late 2012 and newer; Mac Pro late 2013 and newer; MacBook 2015 and newer</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2201910/812975664/d69b1fe2c668bfc26d1ca3b47d2589a2efc273f0/17581982